+Pure in-memory code inspection/parsing/editing uses a separate CodeSyntaxOperations
+port in etas_code. Do not add unapproved Code.parse/reflection actions or perform
+I/O behind ^. There is no public std.compiler.load/Code.load or binary export
+surface. Source restoration uses ordinary storage then typed target validation,
+parse/with_body/compile with locked environment and current authority/limits.
